erential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282" :question/answer-fields "aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823"] [:db/ensure "ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282"] [:db/add "356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42" :answer/id #uuid "356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42"] [:db/add "356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e" :answer/id #uuid "7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e"] [:db/add "7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6" :answer/id #uuid "137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6"] [:db/add "137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "acddae16-70ca-5fa3-ac17-19f9dfc59096" :answer/id #uuid "acddae16-70