\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504" :question/answer-fields "7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f"] [:db/ensure "a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504"] [:db/add "07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1" :answer/id #uuid "07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1"] [:db/add "07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1" :answer/value "3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4" :answer/id #uuid "5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4"] [:db/add "5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "5b3f02eb-d44e-