t(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "94bdb05f-43fe-5e78-b307-235e180d305b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 4=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "94bdb05f-43fe-5e78-b307-235e180d305b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "94bdb05f-43fe-5e78-b307-235e180d305b" :question/answer-fields "45395d8a-6aaa-567d-a6f9-d5037bc36c11"] [:db/ensure "94bdb05f-43fe-5e78-b307-235e180d305b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "94bdb05f-43fe-5e78-b307-235e180d305b"] [:db/add "81890c2f-78e2-5a08-b6c6-c6584837ddf2" :answer/id #uuid "81890c2f-78e2-5a08-b6c6-c6584837ddf2"] [:db/add "81890c2f-78e2-5a08-b6c6-c6584837ddf2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "81890c2f-78e2-5a08-b6c6-c6584837ddf2" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "81890c2f-78e2-5a08-b6c6-c6584837ddf2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dd3e0d5c-1889-51df-b42c-5c97a8acb8a5" :answer/id #uuid "dd3e0d5c-1889-51df-b42c-5c97a8acb8a5"] [:db/add "dd3e0d5c-1889-51df-b42c-5c97a8acb8a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dd3e0d5c-1889-51df-b42c-5c97a8acb8a5" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "dd3e0d5c-1889-51df-b42c-5c