uding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "94849f5f-2cf8-5cf1-8a7d-c7ccc0fffc35" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "94849f5f-2cf8-5cf1-8a7d-c7ccc0fffc35" :question/answer-fields "a05b84b7-cde5-5dcd-8b23-dd8470aad214"] [:db/ensure "94849f5f-2cf8-5cf1-8a7d-c7ccc0fffc35" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "94849f5f-2cf8-5cf1-8a7d-c7ccc0fffc35"] [:db/add "552c69bc-c59f-5d0a-bc7b-d9da24a5d29e" :answer/id #uuid "552c69bc-c59f-5d0a-bc7b-d9da24a5d29e"] [:db/add "552c69bc-c59f-5d0a-bc7b-d9da24a5d29e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "552c69bc-c59f-5d0a-bc7b-d9da24a5d29e" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "552c69bc-c59f-5d0a-bc7b-d9da24a5d29e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5ff0da6f-b0b1-587a-ad37-ddaf219910f1" :answer/id #uuid "5ff0da6f-b0b1-587a-ad37-ddaf219910f1"] [:db/add "5ff0da6f-b0b1-587a-ad37-ddaf219910f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5ff0da6f-b0b1-587a-ad37-ddaf219910f1" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "5ff0da6f-b0b1-587a-ad37-ddaf219910f1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "16d15460-c344-58be-bd6c-ff5c5aa66b99" :answer/id #uuid "16d15460-c344-58be-bd6c-ff5c5aa66b99"] [:db/add "16d15460-c344-58be-bd6c-ff5c5aa66b99" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "16d15460-c344-58be-bd6c-ff5c5aa66b99" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "16d15460-c344-58be-bd6c-ff5c5aa66b99" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1e1faca6-79c7-5000-b9b6-3ac601b2f9bc" :answer/id #uuid "1e1faca6-79c7-5000-b9b6-3ac601b2f9bc"] [:db/add "1e1faca6-79c7-5000-b9b6-3ac601b2f9bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1e1faca6-79c7-5000-b9b6-3ac601b2f9bc" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "1e1faca6-79c7-5000-b9b6-3ac601b2f9bc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4cc57df7-0fcb-50a2-8631-72fc23faf0e1" :answer/id #uuid "4cc57df7-0fcb-50a2-8631-72fc23faf0e1"] [:db/add "4cc57df7-0fcb-50a2-8631-72fc23faf0e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4cc57df7-0fcb-50a2-8631-72fc23faf0e1" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "4cc57df7-0fcb-50a2-8631-72fc23faf0e1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/id #uuid "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c"] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/choices "552c69bc-c59f-5d0a-bc7b-d9da24a5d29e"] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/choices "5ff0da6f-b0b1-587a-ad37-ddaf219910f1"] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/choices "16d15460-c344-58be-bd6c-ff5c5aa66b99"] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/choices "1e1faca6-79c7-5000-b9b6-3ac601b2f9bc"] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/choices "4cc57df7-0fcb-50a2-8631-72fc23faf0e1"] [:db/add "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/correct "552c69bc-c59f-5d0a-bc7b-d9da24a5d29e"] [:db/ensure "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "df9de8b9-2f01-568f-aeb5-4514cd0a2608" :question/id #uuid "df9de8b9-2f01-568f-aeb5-4514cd0a2608"] [:db/add "df9de8b9-2f01-568f-aeb5-4514cd0a2608" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "df9de8b9-2f01-568f-aeb5-4514cd0a2608" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{3 x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{1}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "df9de8b9-2f01-568f-aeb5-4514cd0a2608" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "df9de8b9-2f01-568f-aeb5-4514cd0a2608" :question/answer-fields "815fa613-54ca-5424-b2a4-b9796145743c"] [:db/ensure "df9de8b9-2f01-568f-aeb5-4514cd0a2608" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "df9de8b9-2f01-568f-aeb5-4514cd0a2608"] [:db/add "ce1ef3f3-0241-5334-9309-241a050c9cc4" :answer/id #uuid "ce1ef3f3-0241-5334-9309-241a050c9cc4"] [:db/add "ce1ef3f3-0241-5334-9309-241a050c9cc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ce1ef3f3-0241-5334-9309-241a050c9cc4" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "ce1ef3f3-0241-5334-9309-241a050c9cc4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2905b413-bec8-5457-a9ab-da7f8c1307bf" :answer/id #uuid "2905b413-bec8-5457-a9ab-da7f8c1307bf"] [:db/add "2905b413-bec8-5457-a9ab-da7f8c1307bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2905b413-bec8-5457-a9ab-da7f8c1307bf" :answer/valu