93ff-df4783c50a60" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - 16 x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(2 x)^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{4}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ac7ccb86-e562-5c18-93ff-df4783c50a60" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "ac7ccb86-e562-5c18-93ff-df4783c50a60" :question/answer-fields "78a2c40b-4f5e-5b3d-a066-8a1ca5b2c47a"] [:db/ensure "ac7ccb86-e562-5c18-93ff-df4783c50a60" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "ac7ccb86-e562-5c18-93ff-df4783c50a60"] [:db/add "fb8f1faa-f18a-5aa1-b0b0-c697df5e8afa" :answer/id #uuid "fb8f1faa-f18a-5aa1-b0b0-c697df5e8afa"] [:db/add "fb8f1faa-f18a-5aa1-b0b0-c697df5e8afa" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fb8f1faa-f18a-5aa1-b0b0-c697df5e8afa" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "fb8f1faa-f18a-5aa1-b0b0-c697df5e8afa" :answer/validate] [:db/add "062ae717-b9a3-5334-9e9f-4ff3f9a033b6" :answer/id #uuid "062ae717-b9a3-5334-9e9f-4ff3f9a033b6"] [:db/add "062ae717-b9a3-5334-9e9f-4ff3f9a033b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "062ae717-b9a3-5334-9e9f-4ff3f9a033b6" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "062ae717-b9a3-5334-9e9f-4ff3f9a033b6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "708e6670-ad76-5e90-9